card.statement:
We have

\begin{equation*}
b \ast a\equiv \sum_{i\geq 0}{\Delta_a -1 \choose i}a_{(i-1)}b  \quad \pmod{ V\circ V},
\end{equation*}

and hence,

\begin{equation*}
\begin{split}
a \ast b -b\ast a &\equiv \sum_{i\geq 0}{\Delta_a-1 \choose i}a_{(i)}b  \quad
\pmod{ V\circ V}.
\end{split}
\end{equation*}
